isture. Our Health and Beauty Blend contains plant-based botanical extracts to support healthy skin and free radical damage. Vitamin C has protective properties and plays an integral role in collagen synthesis for skin health."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no artificial colors, flavors or preservatives; no wheat, gluten, milk, eggs, peanuts, tree nuts, soy, crustacean shellfish or fish."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"We guarantee our supplements for potency and purity"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"To report a serious adverse event, call 1-888-710-0006"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Regernerage Collagen Complete with Health and Beauty Blend"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Supports skin elasticity and firmness\r\nFights free-radical damage"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"No GMO ingredients\r\nDouble Verified GF Gluten Free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No GMO ingredients\r\nDouble Verified GF Gluten Free"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested use: Take three capsules daily with food."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2024-11-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredien